<figure class="viz viz--funnel" data-viz="household-funnel" id="funnel">
  <figcaption class="viz__cap">
    <span class="viz__family">Household Money Funnel</span>
    <span class="viz__q">Where did it come from · where did it go?</span>
  </figcaption>
  <ol class="funnel">
    <li class="funnel__step funnel__step--in">
      <strong>Income enters</strong>
      <span>Wages · benefits · ownership income · applicable public benefits</span>
    </li>
    <li class="funnel__step">
      <strong>Essential costs</strong>
      <span>Housing · food · healthcare · energy · transport · care</span>
    </li>
    <li class="funnel__step">
      <strong>Required obligations</strong>
      <span>Taxes · debt service · non-negotiable dues</span>
    </li>
    <li class="funnel__step funnel__step--out">
      <strong>Prosperity surplus</strong>
      <span>Emergency → savings → ownership → capability → investment → time → inheritance</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="viz__note">
    High nominal income with near-zero surplus is not victory. The funnel makes usable remainder visible.
  </p>
</figure>
